  "materials": {},
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "architecture",
      "title": "从 headless 任务进入插件运行时",
      "objectives": [
        "在固定提交指出 base、headless runner、Agent 注册表与默认驱动的职责。",
        "沿创建与输入两条链找到 ReactLoopAgent，而不是仅凭同名符号推断调用。",
        "说出本课公开范围及没有覆盖的资料。"
      ],
      "priorKnowledge": [
        "理解 TypeScript 类、Promise 和插件注入。",
        "知道配置可以替换服务；本课只读代码，不运行 dsh。"
      ],
      "prerequisiteLessons": [],
      "concepts": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "先看整体：base 配置挂载 llm、session 等服务，并启用原生工具执行器和默认 Agent Loop；headless patch 插入 startup 与 runner。这是公开的插件组合，不是模型服务端的实现。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "base-services",
            "base-executor",
            "headless-config"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "headless run 在新会话分支读取模型选择，通过 agents.create 获得 Agent，再用 followup 提交任务。注册表负责工厂转交，AgentLoop 负责构造默认驱动。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "entry",
            "submit",
            "registry",
            "factory-register",
            "factory-create",
            "factory-machine"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "advice",
          "text": "本课范围：固定公开版本、默认 base 的 headless 新会话及 native 工具路径。Web/Desktop/SDK/ACP、恢复/分叉、PTC 与自定义 patch 未逐条取证；模型权重、训练及托管服务端内部也不能从这些调用点推出。遇到这些问题请登记疑问，不把未覆盖写成未实现。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "entry",
            "headless-config",
            "base-executor"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sourceReading": [
        "base-services",
        "base-executor",
        "headless-config",
        "entry",
        "registry",
        "factory-register",
        "factory-create",
        "factory-machine",
        "submit",
        "input",
        "wake",
        "driver"
      ],
      "keySymbols": [
        {
          "name": "run",
          "sourceRef": "entry"
        },
        {
          "name": "create",
          "sourceRef": "registry"
        },
        {
          "name": "createAgent",
          "sourceRef": "factory-create"
        },
        {
          "name": "initializeAgent",
          "sourceRef": "factory-machine"
        },
        {
          "name": "followup",
          "sourceRef": "input"
        }
      ],
      "execution": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "1. 新会话场景：run 将默认模型选择放入 agentOptions，生成 sessionId，通过 agents.create 创建；有 sessionId 的恢复分支不在本课追踪范围。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "entry"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "2. AgentRegistry.create 取得工厂，以调用者上下文转交 createAgent；AgentLoop 服务初始化时通过 setFactory 登记自身。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "registry",
            "factory-register"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "3. createAgent 准备会话并调用 initializeAgent；initializeAgent 构造 ReactLoopAgent。创建还涉及持久化与生命周期管理，本章只取通往驱动的调用链。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "factory-create",
            "factory-machine"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "4. runner 的 followup 把任务作为 user 消息送入 Agent；followup 使用 next-turn 和 wakeup=true，send 插入 inbox 并调用 wakeDriver。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "submit",
            "input"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "5. 空闲时 wakeDriver 将状态设为 running 并启动 kick；kick 通过 while(await turn()) 消费后续轮次。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "wake",
            "driver"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "calls": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "创建链：headless run → AgentRegistry.create → 已登记 AgentLoop.createAgent → initializeAgent → new ReactLoopAgent。调用通过工厂接口转交，不是注册表硬编码 new。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "entry",
            "registry",
            "factory-register",
            "factory-create",
            "factory-machine"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "输入链：run → followup → send → wakeDriver → kick → turn。inject 使用 wakeup=false，不能当成 followup 的同义词。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "submit",
            "input",
            "wake",
            "driver"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "scenario": "教学场景：用户让本机 headless 解释一段业务代码，未传 sessionId，默认 base 已挂载且模型选择可用。先找谁创建会话，再追谁接收任务；这里不执行 CLI、不连接模型，也不把这一入口推广为 Web 或 SDK 的全部流程。",
      "designRationale": [
        {
          "kind": "inference",
          "text": "注册表转交工厂、默认循环自行登记，表明创建接口与具体驱动有替换边界；由调用结构可以推断这减少了入口对具体类的依赖，但这不是对作者全部设计动机的断言。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "registry",
            "factory-register",
            "factory-machine"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "advice",
          "text": "独立实现时可先区分“创建运行时”和“投递任务”两个动作，再决定是否需要插件系统。简单场景不必照搬完整生命周期。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "entry",
            "submit",
            "input"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "faq": [
        {
          "question": "DeepSeek 公开仓库是否只有模型 API 接口？",
          "answer": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "text": "不是。所核对的公开配置和代码包括会话、Agent 工厂、默认循环与工具执行器；本课将沿这些实际组件学习。公开目录存在仍不代表所有子系统都已完成课程审稿。",
            "sourceRefs": [
              "base-services",
              "base-executor",
              "factory-machine"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "资料缺口：能从这里解释模型内部或所有部署吗？",
          "answer": {
            "kind": "advice",
            "text": "不能。模型调用边界只说明 Harness 怎样准备和消费请求；不同 profile 和 patch 可改变入口、工具与策略。本课未验证模型服务端、所有 profile、各操作系统沙箱或真实运行结果；保留为后续独立取证问题。",
            "sourceRefs": [
              "headless-config",
              "entry",
              "base-executor"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
          "id": "factory-boundary",
          "kind": "single-choice",
          "prompt": "在新会话分支，AgentRegistry.create 怎样进入默认 AgentLoop？",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "direct",
              "text": "注册表直接 new ReactLoopAgent"
            },
            {
              "id": "factory",
              "text": "取得已登记工厂，再转交 createAgent"
            },
            {
              "id": "model",
              "text": "模型响应负责创建 Agent"
            }
          ],
          "correctOption": "factory",
